<title>SINGAPORE: TIBS drops suit against Singapore Bus.</title>
<headline>TIBS drops suit against Singapore Bus.</headline>
<dateline>SINGAPORE 1997-08-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>TIBS Holdings Ltd said on Friday it had dropped legal action against Singapore Bus Service (SBS) pending an out-of-court settlement.</p>
<p>It said in a statement its subsidiary Trans-Island Bus Services Ltd had begun legal proceedings against SBS last year in connection with the apportionment ratio of revenue from the sale of monthly concession stamps by SBS.</p>
<p>TIBS provided no other details.</p>
